OL,3,GNEWSAPeople urged to get tested for
OL,4,Asyphilis over high rates
OL,5,
OL,6,FSyphilis is a bacterial infection that
OL,7,Fcan be cured with antibiotics but many
OL,8,Fpeople experience no symptoms at all,
OL,9,Fmeaning infections can go undetected
OL,10,Fand be passed on unknowingly.
